	(text "J4 is a USB 2.0 device port. CC1 and CC2 have independent 5.1 kΩ pull-downs.\nRoute both plug orientations through D5 and keep the differential pair over L2.\nSet C26 and C27 next to U4 pin 2. Keep the antenna clear on every layer."
		(at 338 309 0)
		(effects
